From 7ae783faafcdddab6b6526eb9b5856a69e6070f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:13:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Execution policies: tests of the rules, documentation of the
 defaults

- GenericParallelCUDATest: a policy of another backend, an asynchronous
  policy refused by BatchExecutionPolicy, a synchronous computation with
  AsynchronousBatchExecutionPolicy (the stream is idle on return).
- The tests of the generic-parallel interfaces are built only if the runtime
  of the execution policies is found.
- The documentation of the overloads without execution policy mentions the
  default execution policy of the backend instead of the removed null queue.
---
 include/MGIS/Behaviour/Behaviour.hxx          | 22 ++---
 .../MaterialProperty/MaterialProperty.hxx     | 10 +--
 tests/CMakeLists.txt                          |  9 ++-
 tests/GenericParallelCUDATest.cxx             | 81 ++++++++++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 103 insertions(+), 19 deletions(-)

